---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Rosternado — Support"
  description="Support and contact information for Rosternado, the flight roster sharing app for aviation crew."
>
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow legal">
    <header class="page-head">
        <h1>Support</h1>
      </header>
    
      <div class="card card--text">
        <h2>Contact &amp; Support</h2>
        <p>Questions, bug reports, or feedback? We respond within 2&ndash;3 business days.</p>
        <a class="email" href="mailto:info@rosternado.com">info@rosternado.com</a>
      </div>
    
      <div class="card card--text">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">How do I upload my roster?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Press the Roster Download icon at the top right corner. Your airline's roster website opens in-app &mdash; sign in
            and tap Save to import your duties.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Does Rosternado sync automatically with my airline's crew portal?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">No. Your roster only changes when you import it again (Roster Download &rarr; Save) or edit
            duties yourself &mdash; changes made by crewing are not picked up automatically. Rosternado is not an official
            source and should not be used as your primary reference for duties. Always check your company's crew portal.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Who can see my roster?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Only friends you have accepted. Rosters are private by default and never appear in search.
          </div>
        </div>
    
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">My airline isn't supported for upload.</div>
          <div class="faq-a">You can still add duties manually. Email us your airline &mdash; we add parsers over time.
            A saved copy of your roster page helps most: <a href="/add-your-airline.html">here's how to send it</a>.
          </div>
        </div>
    
        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">How do I delete my account?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Profile &rarr; Delete Account. This permanently removes your profile, roster, and
            friendships.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">Does deleting my account cancel my subscription?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">No. Pro is billed by the App Store or Google Play and belongs to your Apple ID or Google
            account, so deleting your Rosternado account does not stop billing. Cancel it in your store first &mdash;
            on iOS: Settings &rarr; [your name] &rarr; Subscriptions; on Android: Play Store &rarr; Profile &rarr;
            Payments &amp; subscriptions &rarr; Subscriptions.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <div class="faq-q">How do I manage my subscription?</div>
          <div class="faq-a">Subscriptions are managed through your App Store or Google Play account settings on your
            device.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
